stions&#xa;从完整数据集随机抽取&#xa;通用知识问答&#xa;1,000条" style="shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=15;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#E8F5E9;strokeColor=#4CAF50;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="544" y="360" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="7" value="抽样TriviaQA&#xa;从完整数据集随机抽取&#xa;通用知识问答&#xa;1,000条" style="shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=15;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#E8F5E9;strokeColor=#4CAF50;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="544" y="544" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="8" value="筛选AlpacaEval&#xa;Helpful-base和Vicuna子集&#xa;移除数学与代码问题&#xa;199条" style="shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=15;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#E8F5E9;strokeColor=#4CAF50;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="544" y="728" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="9" value="合成语音指令&#xa;使用作者TTS模型&#xa;转换Web、Trivia和Alpaca提示&#xa;按组件保留公开音频" style="rounded=1;arcSize=20;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#E3F2FD;strokeColor=#2196F3;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;verticalAlign=middle;align=center" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="864" y="624" width="200" height="100" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="10" value="组装OpenAudioBench&#xa;五个音频组件&#xa;202 + 300 + 1,000 + 1,000 + 199&#xa;合计2,701条" style="shape=cylinder3;boundedLbl=1;backgroundOutline=1;size=15;html=0;convertToSvg=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fillColor=#E8F5E9;strokeColor=#4CAF50;strokeWidth=1.5;fontColor=#212121;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Arial, Helvet